{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "73c090bc5b7f56c70d574c0c42163917e241888a1113980a0f33edd4be5bda8a", "ja": "ん～……むむむ……。\nふむ～……。", "zh": "嗯～……唔唔唔……  \n唔姆～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a154cb08e51ca2875b2a7286ccc8749bda8e08cf265764eabf1fb1fc57a4947a", "ja": "（麗花がプロデュースした服を着て考え込んでる……。\n気になるけど、麗花の反応を今は待とう）", "zh": "（丽花穿着自己设计的衣服，正陷入沉思……\n虽然有点在意，但现在还是先等丽花的反应吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e96564137d9464ee809f1e5a8eba72a8c59d18570cb922f666868b8d8e76899", "ja": "はい！　とっても普通です！　私の考えていた\nザ・普通！がそのまま形になってます！　すご～い♪", "zh": "是的！非常普通！完全就是我想象中的那种——普通！太厉害了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1003_p", "source_sha256": "125d42b9b08f7f96299c53969c0184eaf46966ae1979219102961bcf943ed009", "ja": "ホッ……。\n麗花のお眼鏡にかなったみたいで安心したよ。", "zh": "呼……\n看来符合丽花的眼光，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f718c3a22f615689110f285d120d5f31576140de4da00834ddc847bb8841094", "ja": "普通代表の普通デューサーさんから見て、どうですか？\n今の私の普通度、何ジュールくらいでしょう？", "zh": "从普通代表的普通制作人先生来看，觉得怎么样？\n我现在的普通度，大概有多少焦耳呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3de9f817b8a0a25b51fd88476dfce1d9c3e4af79f12a56f4956cc855942936a3", "ja": "ジュール……？　そ、そうだな。すごく麗花に\n似合ってるし、満点ジュール、かな？", "zh": "焦耳……？　呃，这个嘛。非常适合丽花，所以……满分焦耳，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "a59a3d199cf241e9537ddb17c5ea505fe58ee55d2a9a5cacf67811e57360c635", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わーい、嬉しいな～♪\nちょっとそこで踊ってきてもいいですか！？", "zh": "真的吗！？哇——好开心啊～♪\n我可以去那边跳一会儿吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d5ceb206a0fe5de8a5fdcc575d77a52b52434b9e1c82a20e4b32fde651a94d20", "ja": "まあ、気持ちはわかるが……また今度にしよう。\n麗花が頑張って考えた大事な服だし。", "zh": "虽然能理解你的心情……但还是下次再说吧。\n毕竟这是丽花努力构思的重要服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1008_p", "source_sha256": "581647471a1fb031bda8f81b254ee73e45e0046ba783de7012a23be16932e9ef", "ja": "それより、ザ・普通って言ったけど、テーマは『普通の\n女の子が楽しく笑顔になれる服』じゃなかったか？", "zh": "不过话说回来，你说这是“非常普通”，但主题不就是“能让普通女孩开心地露出笑容的服装”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "893073dce534b6c3bdcc8c3e499919ffc0ad3e453a42313ea885a792cdb400d9", "ja": "そうですよ？　{$P$}さん、\n笑顔って、実はいろんな種類があるんです。", "zh": "没错哦？{$P$}先生，笑容其实有很多种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "8c8fde6c455d3357280c6e4763b14e7f80ee3a5c2a161139e4f183b5de51d405", "ja": "その中でも私は、楽しい時の笑顔が大好きなんです。\nだって、ワクワクが広がっていく感じがしませんか？", "zh": "其中我最喜欢的，就是开心时的笑容。\n因为那种兴奋的感觉，会不断扩散开来，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1011_p", "source_sha256": "55246914e9ae7ec01c1360bcf3317611d3aaef6a72b3d3fc3db4e44c4b11f91a", "ja": "ワクワクが広がって……。確かに、\n笑顔は笑顔を作るもんな。あ、だからテーマに？", "zh": "让兴奋感扩散开来……确实，笑容会带来更多笑容。啊，所以才把这个定为主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "c7f32e362a4b260e981d30d972aad24319396beccadbceef76a7b08254342339", "ja": "はい。私がこの服で笑顔になるのは当然ですけど。\n買ってくれた人たちにも、笑顔になってほしくて……。", "zh": "是的。穿上这件衣服后，我当然会露出笑容。\n我也希望买下它的人们能露出笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "4914f7071c2c375e6ff1b44d369ae21a0c71b6b64908abc7e6f157a78975986c", "ja": "この服を着て、とびっきりの笑顔になったら、\nきっと周りの人たちも笑顔になると思うんです。", "zh": "穿上这身衣服，露出最灿烂的笑容后，\n周围的人也一定会跟着露出笑容的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "50ca19c6a845f125f50b43a4597a207d0aa8e5ecd86abe3b35df215db1ff3f0c", "ja": "その笑顔を見て、もっともっと楽しい気持ちになって。\nふふっ、笑顔の連鎖の完成ですね！", "zh": "看到那份笑容，心情也会变得越来越开心。\n呵呵，这样一来，笑容的连锁就完成了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4c9279f9bcdea1ed35dc9bb57cbb770046006b2db7cfb3676dbaeae278dbffda", "ja": "なるほど。そういう思いをテーマに込めたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。你把这样的心意融入主题中了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "2732f349865819d885a5bd54847ec2b81e510240fcabd54dcf039c5971fd203a", "ja": "そしてそして！　すっごーく大切なポイントがあるん\nです。それは、とーっても動きやすいこと！", "zh": "还有还有！有一个非常非常重要的要点，\n那就是——活动起来特别方便！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "08551a4fdded8b06bf0bf600d1e06495db7061f379b913d1f0d0117f9abaeae0", "ja": "山登り……は、ちょっと難しいですけど。ドライブとか\nピクニックとか体を動かすにはバッチリだと思います。", "zh": "登山……的话虽然有点难，但去兜风\n或是野餐之类的，想要活动身体时我觉得正合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1018_p", "source_sha256": "15d1c6711cbf62cfca96a201bddb228bc4cebb057cf75bb91b403bc05dffb54f", "ja": "いわれてみれば……！\n笑顔になって、動きやすくて……なんか麗花らしいな。", "zh": "经你这么一说……！\n能让人露出笑容，又方便活动……感觉很有丽花的风格啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "754fbf426475beb8a1c16a57aede963870575cda9eacc6a5b69bd5f131f5eea1", "ja": "そして、もうひとつ大切なポイントがあるんですけど、\n{$P$}さん、わかりましたか？", "zh": "而且，还有一个很重要的要点……\n{$P$}先生，你明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_1020", "source_sha256": "d73a06aa55b0b10d0ffe608053c9b09aef127e1e99ef12446395591dcc2fa720", "ja": "ピッくん！", "zh": "小冰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f28cf9904c51f6028ccadc145d4d4d859ac75c9ad8605cee084e43d535ba2641", "ja": "ピッくんのアクセサリーだ！\n麗花の大事な友達だからな。ピッケルのピッくんは！", "zh": "这是皮克的饰品！皮克可是丽花重要的朋友，毕竟是镐子的皮克嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "87964b81fc561e39dc1c6765901f02cee4019347e9d4e43d1e665bbcf83017a7", "ja": "惜しい……！　正解は眼鏡で～す！　みんなの笑顔を\nたくさん見るためには欠かせませんよね♪", "zh": "差一点……！正确答案是眼镜～！想要多多看到大家的笑容，可少不了它呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_2002_p", "source_sha256": "e74bb424690c3b020bec8f64266fc4394fcb7a6445a842925a4182ae7c06206f", "ja": "ああ、眼鏡はそのために……。\nさすが麗花。一番大切なポイントだな、ははっ。", "zh": "啊，眼镜就是为了这个……  \n不愧是丽花，这可是最重要的一点啊，哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0634_2003_048rei", "source_sha256": "f62dafd2cfb304d9fcfaa6c3bdfce7e0d5e3fcf690750dfebce123004228d118", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さんの\nナイス普通な笑顔を、早速発見です♪　えへへ。", "zh": "啊！我马上就发现了{$P$}先生那张恰到好处的普通笑容♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
